// Goodbye email. Fed by BOTH churn branches, so it reads only $json and never
// references an upstream node by name -- a node that did not run in this execution
// throws when referenced.
//
// Deliberately NOT included: an exit survey, a "why are you leaving?", or a discount.
// methodology.md section 2 documents the real practice -- exit is soft-framed, cordial,
// and ends cleanly at the billing boundary with no post-cancellation analysis.
// Automating a retention pitch here would contradict how Ivan actually coaches.

const T = {
  SPANISH: (n) => ({
    subject: `${n}, confirmación de baja`,
    body:
`Hola ${n},

Te confirmo que tu suscripción quedó cancelada y no se va a cobrar nada más.

Tu acceso al Área de Miembros también quedó dado de baja.

Gracias por el tiempo que entrenamos juntos. Si en algún momento querés volver,
la puerta queda abierta: escribime y lo retomamos.

Éxitos con lo que venga,
Iván Koch
Triaperformance`
  }),
  ENGLISH: (n) => ({
    subject: `${n}, your subscription has been cancelled`,
    body:
`Hi ${n},

Confirming that your subscription has been cancelled and nothing further will be charged.

Your Members Area access has been closed as well.

Thanks for the time we trained together. If you ever want to come back, the door is
open — just write to me and we pick it up again.

All the best,
Ivan Koch
Triaperformance`
  }),
  PORTUGUESE: (n) => ({
    subject: `${n}, confirmação de cancelamento`,
    body:
`Olá ${n},

Confirmo que a sua assinatura foi cancelada e nada mais será cobrado.

O seu acesso à Área de Membros também foi encerrado.

Obrigado pelo tempo que treinamos juntos. Se em algum momento quiser voltar,
a porta fica aberta — é só me escrever e retomamos.

Sucesso no que vier,
Ivan Koch
Triaperformance`
  }),
};

return $input.all().map(item => {
  const d = item.json;
  const lang = T[d.preferredLanguage] ? d.preferredLanguage : 'SPANISH';
  const first = String(d.full_name || '').trim().split(/\s+/)[0] || '';
  const built = T[lang](first);
  return { json: { ...d, to: d.email, langUsed: lang,
                   subject: built.subject, body: built.body,
                   can_send: Boolean(d.email) } };
});

